<view class="page">
 <view class="title">电池估价</view>
<view class="muted">可直接填写电池参数，无需先选择汽车品牌和车型。</view>
 <view class="card space">
<view class="subtitle">电池参数</view>
  <text class="label">材料体系</text>
<picker class="picker" range="{{chemistryLabels}}" value="{{chemistryIndex}}" data-name="chemistry" bindchange="change">{{chemistryLabels[chemistryIndex]}}</picker>
  <view wx:if="{{chemistryIndex === 2}}" class="notice">“小三元”的来源定义及独立价格尚待核实，当前会保存待补数据报告。</view>
  <text class="label">货物形态</text>
<picker class="picker" range="{{goodsLabels}}" value="{{goodsIndex}}" data-name="goods" bindchange="change">{{goodsLabels[goodsIndex]}}</picker>
  <text class="label">电芯封装</text>
<picker class="picker" range="{{formLabels}}" value="{{formIndex}}" data-name="form" bindchange="change">{{formLabels[formIndex]}}</picker>
  <text class="label">估价依据</text>
<picker class="picker" range="{{basisLabels}}" value="{{basisIndex}}" data-name="basis" bindchange="change">{{basisLabels[basisIndex]}}</picker>
  <text class="label">{{basisIndex === 0 ? '该批电池额定总电量（kWh）' : '该批电池实际总重量（kg）'}} *</text>
<input class="input" type="digit" value="{{quantity}}" disabled="{{selectedVehicle !== null}}" data-name="quantity" bindinput="input" placeholder="{{basisIndex === 0 ? '例如 60；1度电=1kWh' : '例如 400；不含车辆及外部包装'}}"/>
  <view wx:if="{{basisIndex === 0}}" class="muted space">填写额定电量，不填仪表剩余电量；不要把Ah直接当作kWh。</view>
  <text class="label">电池状态</text>
<picker class="picker" range="{{conditionLabels}}" value="{{conditionIndex}}" data-name="condition" bindchange="change">{{conditionLabels[conditionIndex]}}</picker>
 </view>
 <view wx:if="{{basisIndex === 0}}" class="card">
<view class="subtitle">缩小参考范围（选填）</view>
<text class="label">电芯品牌</text>
<picker class="picker" range="{{brands}}" value="{{brandIndex}}" data-name="brand" bindchange="change">{{brands[brandIndex]}}</picker>
<text class="label">单体标称容量 Ah</text>
<picker class="picker" range="{{ahLabels}}" value="{{ahIndex}}" data-name="ah" bindchange="change">{{ahLabels[ahIndex]}}</picker>
<view class="muted space">品牌+Ah是来源规格描述，不能据此认定唯一电池型号。</view>
</view>
 <view class="card">
<view class="subtitle">补充信息（选填）</view>
<text class="label">所在城市</text>
<input class="input" value="{{region}}" data-name="region" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如 济南；用于供需对接"/>
<text class="label">车辆或电池备注</text>
<input class="input" value="{{vehicleDescription}}" data-name="vehicleDescription" bindinput="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="例如 年款、版本、铭牌型号"/>
<view class="muted space">城市不参与行情折价；未取得检测证据时，不按里程推算金属折损。</view>
</view>
 <view class="card">
<view class="subtitle">从已核实车辆配置填写（可选）</view>
<view class="row space">
<input class="input grow" value="{{vehicleQuery}}" data-name="vehicleQuery" bindinput="input" placeholder="年款 / 车型 / 配置"/>
<button class="secondary" bindtap="searchVehicle">查询</button>
</view>
<view class="item" wx:for="{{vehicles}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectVehicle">{{item.label}}</view>
<view wx:if="{{selectedVehicle}}">
<view class="notice">{{selectedVehicle.label}}</view>
<checkbox-group bindchange="confirmOriginal">
<label class="check">
<checkbox value="yes" checked="{{originalBatteryConfirmed}}" color="#146a50"/>确认当前仍为该配置原装电池</label>
</checkbox-group>
<button class="ghost" bindtap="clearVehicle">改为手动填写</button>
</view>
</view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
<button class="primary full" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">生成并保存报告</button>
<view class="bottom-note">有来源的行情测算 · 缺失数据会明确标注</view>
</view>
